web/node_modules/

# P10: the offline basemap NEVER enters git (or the wheel — see pyproject exclude-package-data + MANIFEST).
# web/basemap/ is the download-once cache; webdist/basemap/ is its post-build hardlink (sync-basemap.mjs).
# The blanket *.pmtiles line also catches a misplaced extract anywhere in the tree (sweep L12).
web/basemap/
nl2sql_roadsafety/webdist/basemap/
*.pmtiles

